---
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title={SITE_TITLE}
  description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
  className="flex max-w-xl flex-col justify-center"
>
  <main class="space-y-4">
    <img
      src="/static/avatar.jpg"
      class="mx-auto my-4 h-48 w-48 rounded-full object-cover"
      alt="Avatar"
    />
    <h1 class="text-center font-mono text-2xl font-bold">Hello, World!</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Enzo Shiraishi, a software engineer and backyard AI scientist from
      Brazil, passionate about everything coding and AI. I currently develop the
      busiest chatbot in Latin America at Itaú, the region's largest bank and
      the main company of the biggest financial conglomerate in the Southern
      Hemisphere.
    </p>
    <p>
      Since 2020, I have taken on roles as a software engineer, data analyst,
      machine learning engineer, and applied scientist. My work has focused on
      NLP throughout this time - that is before ChatGPT! - and I have at some
      point contributed to every stage of the LLM application development cycle
      in different projects: from pretraining and finetuning foundational
      models, to building and deploying end-user applications at scale for
      millions of users.
    </p>
    <p>
      In my free time, I love contributing to open source. If you check my
      GitHub profile, I have contributed to some open source projects and plan
      to work on many more. If you are interested in my work or have ideas to
      share, feel free to reach out! Outside of tech, I enjoy listening to
      leftfield music, playing RPGs, traveling, and watching movies. If you do
      too, feel free to reach out as well!
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
